close_reason: "Certified pm CLI 2026.9.21: the completeness gate treats an absent read_output as no-compaction-receipt (pm-g8oh0f, pm >=2026.9.18) while staying fail-closed through truncated/has_more/next_cursor/output_budget_truncation/count-vs-total; prepare hook is now the thin canonical pm-ops merge-driver launcher and CI requires merge drivers."
body: "Wave of 2026-09-22 (companion epic pm-cli-website-5s6z): pin 2026.9.21 and move the prepare hook onto pm-ops/merge-driver."
